//cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159156605783248896139725.jpeg/Nn-oP5n_mOlxDA4I4L2aPfFUa_kha1zlgWWPZYFlj2U\"/><figcaption>美國男子奇法爾迪（David Cifaldi）在登山時，身體遭登山杖刺穿。（YouTube@KCENNews）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美國男子奇法爾迪（David Cifaldi）在登山時，身體遭登山杖刺穿。（YouTube@KCENNews）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159156603505610752432769.png/wUf0ZsmXFWEa242C0JYLqkH0ptV1AR4zNi7x-DYu8fg\"/><figcaption>美國男子奇法爾迪（David Cifaldi）在登山時，身體遭登山杖刺穿。（YouTube@KCENNews）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T07:38:30.783699+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":3400,"images":35,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}